    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B08a scope (billing/admin/misc)","items":["Part of B08-billing-internal-misc split (reconciled 41 routes/16 controllers). Modules: billing (13/3), admin-usage (6/2), governed-prompt (1/1), pstudio (1/2) = 21 routes / 8 controllers.","Billing/usage: admin invoices and usage plus tenant self billing/usage under /tenants/me. Governed prompt: internal POST /internal/governed-prompts for verification/registry checks. Prisma Studio: admin pstudio/status and pstudio surfaces (sensitive admin DB tooling).","Grouped endpoint nodes for readability."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Billing admin/invoices and tenant self billing: query/list/invoice operations -> billing/invoice/entitlement-adjacent responses. Verify exact DTOs and billing provider integration details.","Admin/tenant usage: usage queries -> aggregated usage metrics/records. Verify time windows, tenant scoping, and data sources.","Governed prompt internal: verification request payload (pieces/prompts) -> verification/registry response. Service-to-service; verify DTO and idempotency/security semantics.","Prisma Studio: status/start/proxy related admin requests -> studio status/proxy behavior. Highly sensitive admin-only surface; verify RBAC, environment restrictions, and audit controls."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence, security, limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controllers/services verified (BillingService, GovernedPromptRegistryService, PrismaStudioService).","Governed prompt internal controller uses @Public/@ApiExcludeController with HarnessServiceTokenGuard + InternalTenantLockGuard (evidenced). Prisma Studio is an admin DB tooling surface — treat as sensitive.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (21 routes/8 controllers); admin-usage service implementation path not separately verified in this pass; reconcile exact route/DTO contracts, RBAC, and operational safeguards with OpenAPI/implementation."]}
